Goal: Implement a `refine` command to create new task versions based on feedback, archiving old versions to preserve history.
Decisions: Use Bun runtime and `bun:test` for CLI and testing; `commander.js` for CLI argument parsing; Atomic write-and-rename strategy for JSON file persistence; Tasks stored in `~/.taskforge/tasks.json`; Archived tasks and summaries stored in `~/.taskforge/history.jsonl` (JSON Lines); Task model supports parent-child (`parentId`, `subtaskIds`) and versioning (`previousVersionId`); LLM integration for task decomposition and refinement
